tellraw @a {"translate":"%1$s has found the hidden advancement %2$s%3$s%4$s","with":[{"selector":"@s"},{"color":"light_purple","text":"["},{"color":"light_purple","translate":"I should riddle you a job","hover_event":{"action":"show_text","value":{"color":"light_purple","translate":"I should riddle you a job","extra":[{"text":"\n"},{"color":"#DE4ADC","translate":"The first is to trap wanderers, a \"cinq\" to be exact\nas close as a chunk, make them work as a pact.\nThe second is to trade for every book at its max,\nFrom the Librarian’s shelf, paying with no tax.\nThe third is to sign a résumé, not one but a ton,\nA hundred quills signed in your pack, and the work's just begun.\nThe fourth is to craft from the cane by the river,\nA \"job application\" that you're ready to deliver.\nThe fifth is to raid, let their attacks fall,\nFrom plains unto tundra, bring employment to role.\nThe sixth is a switch, their homes intertwine,\nthe priest that takes gold, as does the swine.\nThe seventh is cruel, though its symbol is blessed,\nend the pig's children, seven at best.\nThe eighth is a trade to construe:\neight suns in a row, the hare's banquet for you.\nThe ninth is a vagrant in a mansion of dread,\nlet him live through nine sunsets, unclaimed, unfed.\nThe tenth is a jest, you've surely lost class,\nto reach it at all means you'll need some grass.\nBut conquer it whole, no reason to sob,\nfor you'll earn in the end a true J.O.B.\nAnd look in your inventory, don't let it slip past!\nyou now hold The Forbidden Unemployment Tasks.\n\nSuggested by honestlytzadok"},{"text":"\n\n"},{"color":"gray","italic":true,"translate":"Super Challenges"},{"text":" "},{"color":"gray","italic":true,"translate":"tab"}]}}},{"color":"light_purple","text":"]"}]}